    "notes": [
      "Editable component placements and native component cutters extracted from the source. The plate is an enclosing rectangular blank; custom outlines, table holes, labels, and non-component fixtures are not imported. Beam connections are recovered only where source beam segments pass through known component origins; unmatched segments are omitted. Connect additional optical centers as needed.",
      "The source vapor-cell mesh ignores its show flag. The importer guards that display-only mesh so it is excluded from drilling; native holder holes and the cylindrical clearance pocket are retained.",
